            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Evaluation of plant site in Nebraska\n\n# Included processes\nThe publication contains only cumulative results. So the emissions from energy consumption, waste water treatement and raw material inputs have been subtracted resulting in a difference in NMVOC emissions.shown in this process.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
